[{"id":4229762554,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc78HQ36","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Discussed in the audio meeting.\r\n\r\nThe early return is uncontroversially appropriate.\r\n\r\nAs for changing the default: The issue description convinced us that this is worth breaking compat for, as it affects only a minority of users while solving a performance problem for everyone else.\r\n\r\nUsers will only be affected if two are true:\r\n1. They actually use the feature (which appears to be rare, probably because the feature isn't super usable).\r\n2. They have `area_mask` set to default (`==1`). Most people with actual setups will likely have it set to something else.\r\n\r\nEven then, affected users (now likely down to a handful) can see the change in the changelog, and fix it by setting the `area_mask` to 1 on update.\r\n\r\nSlating this fix for 4.7 as it addresses important issues.\r\n\r\nThanks to @goatchurchprime and Bippinbits for bringing this to our attention!","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godo